holes in a fixed shape. the shape is the fact, the fill is the call.

logic in a template is logic you cannot test. a conditional says the shape
is two shapes — write two.

the test: render it with the data missing. what remains should still be a
readable artifact of its kind — valid html, a legible letter, a file that
compiles. if it is confetti, shape and fill are interleaved.

the smallest `programming/dsls` — one production, no grammar. reach past it
when the fills start needing each other.
